graph TD
    DOC[Sensitive Document<br/>plaintext] --> DEK

    subgraph "HsmClient — hardware boundary"
        KEK[KEK stored in slot<br/>never returned to caller]
        DEK[ephemeral DEK<br/>randomBytes 256-bit]
        DEK -->|AES-256-GCM encrypt| CT[ciphertext]
        KEK -->|AES-256-GCM wrap| WD[wrappedDek]
        ZERO([dek.fill zero after wrap])
        DEK --> ZERO
    end

    CT --> ON[on-ledger record<br/>encryptedRecord + wrappedDek]
    WD --> ON

    ON -.->|authorised party<br/>same HSM slot| DEC[decryptWithEnvelope]
    DEC --> PT[plaintext recovered]
